---
import { communityTopics } from '../../data/community';
---

<section
  id="life"
  class="community-life content-width"
  aria-labelledby="life-title"
>
  <div class="life-body">
    <div class="life-topics">
      <h2 id="life-title">社群日常</h2>
      <div class="topic-grid">
        {
          communityTopics.map((topic) => (
            <article class="topic-card">
              <h3>{topic.title}</h3>
              <p>{topic.description}</p>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </div>
    <aside class="community-rhythm" aria-labelledby="rhythm-title">
      <h3 id="rhythm-title">社群節奏</h3>
      <p class="rhythm-main">
        有時幾句就停，有時會從<span class="keep-together">一部作品</span
        >一路聊開。
      </p>
      <p>不用每天報到，隔一陣子再冒泡也可以。安靜的時候，不用找話題硬撐。</p>
      <p>如果你期待每天都有大量新訊息，這裡可能跟你想的不一樣。</p>
      <a href="#join">加入前須知 <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
